so ensure frontend proxy works: Vite proxy proxies /api to http://localhost:3000.\n\nWorks.\n\nWe should test restart.\n\nLet's run commands to ensure data directory exists and db file exists.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"run_command","arguments":"{\"command\":\"find /tmp/runs/smokes/muse-q4xl/message-board/interactive/runs/201/app/backend -type f -ls\"}"}}]}
